(506,	222,	'introduction',	'<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"tc9tk\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"27\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Playa del Carmen Airport</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"417\"><strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"747\">Playa del Carmen Airport</strong> is located in the heart of Playa del Carmen, the Playa del Carmen Airport (airstrip) is one of the most conveniently located private aviation facilities in the Riviera Maya. Just a short walk from the famous Fifth Avenue (Quinta Avenida), it offers quick and easy access for travelers flying to and from destinations such as Holbox, Cozumel, Cancun, Mérida and other locations across Mexico.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"734\">Unlike larger commercial airports, Playa del Carmen Airport provides a simple and efficient departure experience with minimal waiting times. It is primarily used by private aircraft, charter flights and general aviation, making it an excellent choice for travelers looking to avoid long lines and crowded terminals.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"739\" />\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Where Is Playa del Carmen Airport Located?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"1024\">Playa del Carmen Airport is located on <strong data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"855\">15th Avenue (Avenida 15)</strong> between <strong data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"898\">1st Street South (Calle 1 Sur)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"937\">3rd Street South (Calle 3 Sur)</strong>, only a few minutes\' walk from the beginning of the famous Fifth Avenue and the beach. See exact location<strong><a href=\"https://share.google/mRm9izmO5mcV9IYOt\"> here</a></strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1141\">Thanks to its central location, most hotels in downtown Playa del Carmen are just a <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1135\">5–15 minute taxi ride</strong> away.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1146\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bvnvr6\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1659\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Playa del Carmen Airport Facilities</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1332\">Playa del Carmen Airport is a small regional airstrip with basic passenger facilities. Visitors should not expect the amenities of a large international airport.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1353\">Facilities include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"uj7uld\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1385\">Small passenger waiting area</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"103vsgk\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1397\">Restrooms</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1gt2rrv\" data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1425\">Private flight operations</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"f8xxj1\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1453\">Basic check-in facilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1467\">Please note:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1w06zuo\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1490\">No air conditioning</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"6fq1g4\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1516\">No restaurants or cafés</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1gol47y\" data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1527\">No shops</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1w0nns6\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1548\">No on-site parking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1636\">Several paid public parking lots are available within walking distance of the airport.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1641\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bvnvr6\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1659\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Playa del Carmen Airport Opening Hours</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1787\">Playa del Carmen Airport is a <strong data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1730\">visual flight rules (VFR) aerodrome</strong>, meaning flights operate <strong data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1786\">during daylight hours only</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1817\"><strong data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1817\">Typical operating hours:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1980\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"b3kpse\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1856\"><strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1856\">Approximately 7:00 AM – 5:30 PM</strong></li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1quvwug\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1942\">Opening and closing times vary throughout the year depending on sunrise and sunset.</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1y2h3zx\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1980\">The airport is <strong data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1979\">closed at night</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"1985\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"39ynrs\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2031\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">How Do I Get to Playa del Carmen Airport?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2069\">The airport is easily accessible by:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2147\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j4cxzg\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2077\">Taxi</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"esfn2m\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2096\">Private transfer with <strong><a href=\"https://goholboxtransfers.com/\">Go Holbox Transfers</a></strong></li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lak2b0\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2134\">Walking (from many downtown hotels)</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"xj254\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2147\">Rental car</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2264\">Because of its central location, travel times are significantly shorter than those to Cancun International Airport.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2269\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1se7vjv\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2312\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Flying from Playa del Carmen to Holbox</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2430\"><strong><a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\">Flights Holbox</a> </strong>operates private charter flights between Playa del Carmen and Holbox in approximately <strong data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2429\">30 minutes</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2610\">Flying from Playa del Carmen is the fastest and most convenient way to reach Holbox Island while avoiding the road transfer to Chiquilá, the ferry crossing and long travel times.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2751\">Passengers enjoy a private departure experience with minimal waiting, making it an excellent option for families, couples and small groups.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10nxbs1\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"205\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Airport Use Fee (TUA)</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"462\">Passengers departing on <strong data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"303\">domestic private charter flights from Playa del Carmen Airport (PCM)</strong> are required to pay an <strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"378\">Airport Use Fee (TUA) of MXN $200 per passenger</strong>. This fee is <strong data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"408\">not included</strong> in the charter price and is payable before departure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"621\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"></p>'),
