(1008,	419,	'introduction',	'The Refugio Animal Holbox is a charity on Holbox island where they rescue, help and take care of animals.\r\n\r\nThey always looks for volunteers.\r\n\r\nAre you visiting the shelter and would like to help us? Your help is always welcome! You can help us by: walking dogs, bathing dogs  cleaning kennels, bowls or the courtyard, playing with the dogs and loving them or monthly voluntary work.'),
