(1263,	476,	'introduction',	'<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"83c71bfd-7562-4610-af06-d98a8747f4fa\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:b9fb996e-130d-42cb-bb85-d1e3343a8d31-5\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:b9fb996e-130d-42cb-bb85-d1e3343a8d31-5\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:b9fb996e-130d-42cb-bb85-d1e3343a8d31-5\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-12\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"1430a56b-f36a-4474-b4cc-4d7508f9ece9\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-5\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<h1 class=\"\" data-section-id=\"1qw47k8\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"33\">Punta Cocos Flamingos in Holbox</h1>\r\n<h2 class=\"\" data-section-id=\"28aook\" data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"71\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Discover Flamingos at Punta Cocos</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"391\">Watching flamingos in their natural habitat is one of the most peaceful and unforgettable experiences on <strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"195\">Holbox Island</strong>. <strong data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"212\">Punta Cocos</strong>, located on the island\'s western side, is one of the best places to spot these elegant pink birds while enjoying quiet beaches, shallow turquoise waters, and spectacular sunsets.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"542\">Whether you\'re a wildlife enthusiast, photographer, or simply looking to experience Holbox\'s natural beauty, Punta Cocos is a must-visit destination.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"547\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pm5dc0\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"574\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Why Visit Punta Cocos?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"819\">Unlike the busier beaches near Holbox town, Punta Cocos offers a more tranquil atmosphere surrounded by nature. It is part of the protected <strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"744\">Yum Balam Nature Reserve</strong>, making it an important habitat for flamingos and many other bird species.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"855\">Visitors love Punta Cocos for its:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"1030\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"zbxru5\" data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"891\">🦩 Flamingo sightings (seasonal)</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"y6f2nx\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"915\">🌅 Incredible sunsets</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1fq6bhz\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"946\">✨ Bioluminescence after dark</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"j44egr\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"969\">🏖️ Peaceful beaches</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1x1jju7\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1004\">📸 Beautiful photo opportunities</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"qzepb3\" data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1030\">🌿 Natural surroundings</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1035\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nuobs\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1067\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">When Can You See Flamingos?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1203\">Flamingos can often be seen between <strong data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1126\">April and October</strong>, although sightings depend on water levels, weather, and migration patterns.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1233\">The best times to visit are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1283\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"rqcr1x\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1250\">Early morning</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1o26vyo\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1267\">Late afternoon</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"116e4ld\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1283\">Around sunset</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1393\">During these quieter hours, flamingos are generally more active and the lighting is perfect for photography.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7b6z7j\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1436\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Other Wildlife Around Punta Cocos</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1480\">Besides flamingos, you may also encounter:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1mrvypx\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1490\">Herons</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1unl6qv\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1501\">Pelicans</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1yskybe\" data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1510\">Egrets</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"41tum1\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1520\">Ospreys</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1y3t1fw\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1535\">Frigatebirds</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"d4v3i7\" data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1568\">Stingrays in the shallow water</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1xo49km\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1611\">Small fish and crabs along the shoreline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1692\">Nature lovers will appreciate the area\'s rich biodiversity throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1697\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7okxmy\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1724\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">What Should You Bring?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1781\">To enjoy your visit comfortably, we recommend bringing:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"10pl9xo\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1794\">Sunscreen</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1o43px\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1800\">Hat</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"11rfapo\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1813\">Sunglasses</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"znt51j\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1830\">Drinking water</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"8cav0c\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1853\">Camera or binoculars</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1b682u8\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1890\">Comfortable sandals or water shoes</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"15une1t\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1929\">Mosquito repellent for sunset visits</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1934\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gpp6ul\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1967\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Can You Swim at Punta Cocos?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2060\">Yes! Punta Cocos features shallow, calm waters that are ideal for relaxing and cooling off.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2207\">While many visitors come for birdwatching and sunsets, it\'s also a wonderful place to enjoy a peaceful swim away from the busier parts of Holbox.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2212\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wjhrlj\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2245\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Stay for the Bioluminescence</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2307\">One of Punta Cocos\' biggest attractions begins after sunset.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2569\">On dark nights, the water can glow with <strong data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2368\">bioluminescence</strong>, a magical natural phenomenon created by microscopic marine organisms. Many visitors spend the afternoon watching flamingos before staying into the evening to experience this unforgettable light show.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2574\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"41qcca\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2615\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">The Fastest Way to Reach Punta Cocos</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2677\">Your Holbox adventure begins with the journey to the island.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2679\" data-end=\"2854\">Instead of spending several hours traveling by road and ferry from Cancun, <strong data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2772\">Flights Holbox</strong> offers private charter flights that reach Holbox in approximately <strong data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2853\">30 minutes</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"3024\">Arriving by air gives you more time to explore Punta Cocos, enjoy the island\'s beaches, spot flamingos, and experience Holbox\'s spectacular sunsets and bioluminescence.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3191\">Whether you\'re planning a romantic getaway, a photography trip, or a family vacation, flying is the fastest and most comfortable way to begin your Holbox experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3310\"><strong data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3310\">Book your private flight with Flights Holbox and discover one of the island\'s most beautiful natural attractions.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section></div>'),
