(2564,	816,	'introduction',	'<hr data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"165\" />\r\n\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"16z3aab\" data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"205\"><span style=\"color: #464749;\">Tulum Airport FBO (Private Terminal)</span></h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"511\"> The <strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"286\">Tulum Airport FBO (Fixed Base Operator)</strong> is the dedicated private terminal at <strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"361\">Tulum International Airport (TQO)</strong>. Unlike the commercial passenger terminal, the FBO allows private charter passengers to enjoy a fast, comfortable, and hassle-free travel experience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"692\">Flights Holbox operates private charter flights to and from the Tulum Airport FBO, offering quick connections to Holbox Island and other destinations across the Yucatán Peninsula.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"697\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6jq5pl\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"733\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Where is the Tulum Airport FBO?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"913\">The private terminal is located within <strong data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"852\">Tulum International Airport (Felipe Carrillo Puerto International Airport)</strong>, approximately <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"888\">45 km (28 miles)</strong> southwest of Tulum town.Tulum Airport is located quiet far  from Tulum center, and airport taxis can be expensive. In many cases, flying to or from Playa del Carmen is a faster and more affordable alternative, especially when factoring in lower airfare and transfer costs.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"1050\">Unlike commercial airline passengers, private flight passengers check in directly at the dedicated <strong data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1049\">General Aviation Terminal (FBO)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1067\"><strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1067\">Google Maps</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1105\"><a href=\"https://share.google/Mm6H0xC2DuEmUTQcD\">FBO location here</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1110\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hsd4qd\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1152\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">How Do I Get to the Private Terminal FBO Tulum?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1213\">The FBO is separate from the commercial passenger terminal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1328\">When flying with Flights Holbox, we recommend to set up your transfer before. You can arrive/ leave by:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"esfn2m\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1348\">Private transfer</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1j4cxzg\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1355\">Taxi</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"xj254\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1368\">Rental car</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1444\">The terminal has convenient drop-off access directly outside the entrance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1444\">Tulum International Airport is located 45 km (28 miles) from Tulum town, and taxi fares can be expensive. Depending on your destination, flying to or from Playa del Carmen may be a quicker and more cost-effective option. When considering the higher airfares to Tulum and the cost of airport transfers, a private flight via Playa del Carmen can often save both time and money.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1449\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11uwpro\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1482\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Check-In for Private Flights</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1540\">Private flights are much quicker than commercial travel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1614\">We recommend arriving <strong>15–20 minutes before your scheduled departure</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1626\">There are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1746\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1jrzhua\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1652\">No long check-in lines</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"g6cxnv\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1681\">No crowded departure halls</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"6nwpmd\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1704\">Minimal waiting time</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lidgig\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1746\">Fast boarding directly to your aircraft</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1751\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14ooqw5\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1774\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Airport Facilities</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1911\">The Tulum Airport FBO offers a comfortable private terminal designed specifically for business aviation and private charter passengers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1932\">Facilities include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2104\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"wqv35z\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1959\">Modern passenger lounge</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"13t66sr\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1987\">Comfortable seating areas</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1a0jcqh\" data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2018\">Air-conditioned waiting room</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1sv3jdl\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2038\">Private restrooms</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"11mkq2c\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2053\">Parking</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"kxp989\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2078\">Direct aircraft access</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"pleuny\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2104\">Passenger drop-off area</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2109\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bvnvr6\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2127\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Opening Hours</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2278\">The FBO operates during airport operating hours, while Flights Holbox schedules private charter flights during <strong data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2258\">daylight hours</strong>, generally between:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2301\"><strong data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2301\">7:00 AM – 5:30 PM</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2383\">Flight times may vary depending on the season, weather conditions, and daylight.</p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3356\" />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n2lztp\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3379\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Weather Conditions</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3466\">Weather in the Riviera Maya can change quickly, particularly during the rainy season.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3468\" data-end=\"3579\">We recommend contacting <strong data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3510\">Flights Holbox</strong> one day before your flight to confirm the latest weather conditions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3780\">If weather conditions are unsafe for flying, we will do our best to arrange a private ground transfer. If we must cancel your flight due to adverse weather, <strong data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3780\">your deposit will be refunded in full.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n2lztp\" data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3379\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">Airport Fee</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3780\"><strong data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"487\">Airport Use Fee (TUA):</strong> Passengers departing on domestic private charter flights from <strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"587\">Tulum International Airport (TQO)</strong> are required to pay an <strong data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"662\">Airport Use Fee (TUA) of around MXN $300 per passenger</strong>. This fee is <strong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"692\">not included</strong> in the charter price and is payable before departure.</p>'),
