(3052,	925,	'content_sections_0_section_content',	'<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"5veygf\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"827\"><span style=\"color: #00467b;\">What is the Cancun Airport FBO?</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"1058\">The Cancun Airport <a href=\"https://share.google/22a4sLJrdXfn2HY5P\">FBO (Fixed Base Operator)</a> is the private aviation terminal at Cancun International Airport. Unlike the commercial terminals (T2, T3 and T4), the FBO is exclusively used for private aircraft and charter flights.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1304\">Flights Holbox operates all private flights to Holbox from this terminal, providing a fast, comfortable and exclusive travel experience. Passengers avoid the busy commercial terminals and enjoy a private check-in before boarding their aircraft.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1421\">The flight from Cancun to Holbox takes approximately <strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1373\">30 minutes</strong>, making it the fastest way to reach the island.</p>'),
