(3064,	925,	'content_sections_3_section_content',	'<div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 35px auto; font-family: Arial,sans-serif;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- Intro Card -->\r\n<div style=\"background: #FAFBFD; border-left: 4px solid #004280; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06); padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #004280; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3;\">Cancun Airport FBO Information</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">Flights Holbox operates private flights to Holbox from the Cancun Airport FBO. This private terminal offers a quieter and more comfortable departure experience away from the busy commercial terminals.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Card 1 -->\r\n<div style=\"background: #FAFBFD; border-left: 4px solid #004280; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06); padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #004280; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3;\">What Is the Cancun Airport FBO?</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">The Cancun Airport FBO, or Fixed Base Operator, is the private aviation terminal at Cancun International Airport. Unlike the commercial terminals, Terminal 2, Terminal 3 and Terminal 4, the FBO is used exclusively for private aircraft and charter flights.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Card 2 -->\r\n<div style=\"background: #FAFBFD; border-left: 4px solid #004280; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06); padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #004280; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3;\">Where Is the Private Terminal in Cancun Located?</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">The private terminal is located inside the grounds of Cancun International Airport. However, it is separate from Terminal 2, Terminal 3 and Terminal 4.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">The FBO is only accessible by road and is not connected to the commercial terminals by a pedestrian walkway or airport shuttle.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Card 3 -->\r\n<div style=\"background: #FAFBFD; border-left: 4px solid #004280; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06); padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #004280; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3;\">How Do I Get to the Private Terminal in Cancun?</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">When arriving on a commercial flight at Terminal 2, Terminal 3 or Terminal 4, you will need to take an authorised airport taxi or a pre-arranged private transfer to the FBO.</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #E6EAF0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 18px 0;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.7;\"><strong style=\"color: #004280;\">Travel time:</strong> Approximately 5–10 minutes</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.7;\"><strong style=\"color: #004280;\">Estimated taxi cost:</strong> Approximately USD 30</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.7;\"><strong style=\"color: #004280;\">Walking:</strong> It is not possible to walk between the commercial terminals and the FBO</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #555555; line-height: 1.7;\"><strong style=\"color: #004280;\">Airport shuttle:</strong> There is no shuttle connection to the private terminal</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">Flights Holbox can help arrange your transfer from the commercial terminal to the Cancun Airport FBO.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Card 4 -->\r\n<div style=\"background: #FAFBFD; border-left: 4px solid #004280; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06); padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #004280; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3;\">Private Flights from Cancun to Holbox</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">Flights Holbox operates private flights to Holbox from this terminal, providing a fast, comfortable and exclusive travel experience. Passengers avoid the busy commercial departure areas and complete a private check-in before boarding their aircraft.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">The flight from Cancun to Holbox takes approximately 30 minutes, making a private flight the fastest way to reach Holbox Island.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Location Card -->\r\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #F4A000; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06); padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #004280; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3;\">Cancun Airport FBO Location</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">Open the exact location of the private terminal in Google Maps before travelling to the airport.</p>\r\n<a style=\"display: inline-block; background: #F4A000; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 24px; border-radius: 7px; font-weight: bold;\" href=\"https://share.google/Ppszco55ELgwR5j6p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\nView the FBO on Google Maps\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- CTA Card -->\r\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg,#004280 0%,#0058A8 100%); border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.08); padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3;\">Book Your Private Flight to Holbox</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 22px; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.8;\">Contact Flights Holbox to request availability and arrange your private flight from Cancun to Holbox.</p>\r\n<a style=\"display: inline-block; background: #F4A000; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 26px; border-radius: 7px; font-weight: bold;\" href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/contact-us/\">\r\nRequest a Flight\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
