(323,	1,	'2026-07-08 17:44:29',	'2026-07-08 16:44:29',	'<!-- wp:acf/hero-panel {\"name\":\"acf/hero-panel\",\"data\":{\"hero_slides_0_slide_image\":838,\"_hero_slides_0_slide_image\":\"field_6a465a86ac589\",\"hero_slides_1_slide_image\":\"\",\"_hero_slides_1_slide_image\":\"field_6a465a86ac589\",\"hero_slides\":2,\"_hero_slides\":\"field_6a465a79ac588\",\"hero_heading\":\"How To Get To Holbox \",\"_hero_heading\":\"field_6a465aa9ac58a\",\"hero_intro\":\"Travel Guide\",\"_hero_intro\":\"field_6a465ab2ac58b\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/news-gallery-panel {\"name\":\"acf/news-gallery-panel\",\"data\":{\"heading\":\"How to get to Holbox Travel  Guide \",\"_heading\":\"field_6a4e7a8748edc\",\"intro\":\"\\u003cp class=\\u0022PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022814\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022842\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022814\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022842\\u0022\\u003ePrivate Flight to Holbox\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022814\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022842\\u0022\\u003e⏱️ \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022695\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022711\\u0022\\u003eTravel Time:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Approximately \\u003cstrong\\u003e30mins\\u003c/strong\\u003e to Holbox\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022847\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221207\\u0022\\u003eA private flight is the fastest and most comfortable way to reach Holbox. Flights from Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum or Cozumel take approximately 30 minutes and land directly on the island, avoiding the drive to Chiquilá and the ferry crossing. Flights Holbox operates private charter flights with experienced commercial pilots and professionally maintained aircraft for up to five passengers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221378\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221263\\u0022\\u003ePrices start at $840 USD per aircraft (one way)\\u003c/strong\\u003e, making private air travel surprisingly affordable for families, couples and small groups when the cost is shared.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221378\\u0022\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/\\u0022\\u003eMore info here\\u003cimg class=\\u0022alignnone size-medium wp-image-764\\u0022 src=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/airport-isla-Holbox-300x225.webp\\u0022 alt=\\u0022private airplane to Holbox arriving at Holbox airport with happy clients\\u0022 width=\\u0022300\\u0022 height=\\u0022225\\u0022 /\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221378\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221378\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch3 class=\\u0022PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\\u0022 data-section-id=\\u002213z8bdx\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022163\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022193\\u0022\\u003ePrivate Transfers to Holbox\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\r\\n⏱️ \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022695\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022711\\u0022\\u003eTravel Time:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Approximately \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022726\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022741\\u0022\\u003e2–2.5 hours\\u003c/strong\\u003e to Chiquilá + \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022756\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022784\\u0022\\u003e30-minute ferry crossing\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022195\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022389\\u0022\\u003eA private transfer is the most convenient way to travel from Cancun Airport to Holbox by road. \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022290\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022313\\u0022\\u003eGo Holbox Transfers\\u003c/strong\\u003e offers two private transportation options for couples, families and groups.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ch4 data-start=\\u0022391\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022424\\u0022\\u003e🚐 Standard Private Transfer\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022425\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022461\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022425\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022461\\u0022\\u003eFrom $2,800 MXN (1–2 passengers)\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cul data-start=\\u0022463\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022644\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022y4u4m0\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022463\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022496\\u0022\\u003ePrivate air-conditioned vehicle\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022h3efex\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022497\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022541\\u0022\\u003eDirect transfer to Chiquilá Ferry Terminal\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u00221cs0i8f\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022542\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022568\\u0022\\u003eFlexible departure times\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022cx2w31\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022569\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022609\\u0022\\u003eNo shared shuttle or unnecessary stops\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022jkm002\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022610\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022644\\u0022\\u003eComfortable and reliable service\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli data-section-id=\\u0022jkm002\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022610\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022644\\u0022\\u003eApproximately \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022726\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022741\\u0022\\u003e2–2.5 hours\\u003c/strong\\u003e to Chiquilá + \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022756\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022784\\u0022\\u003e30-minute ferry crossing\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch4 data-start=\\u0022646\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022677\\u0022\\u003e⭐ VIP Premium Door-to-Door\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022678\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022715\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022678\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022715\\u0022\\u003eFrom $11,500 MXN (1–2 passengers)\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022717\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022804\\u0022\\u003eEverything included for a seamless journey from Cancun Airport to your hotel in Holbox:\\u003c/p\\u0