a-start=\\u00221081\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221275\\u0022\\u003eWhether you choose a Standard or VIP service, you\'ll enjoy the privacy, flexibility and comfort of traveling on your own schedule without waiting for other passengers or making multiple stops.\\u003cimg class=\\u0022alignnone size-medium wp-image-1047\\u0022 src=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/B91A65FD-CBDB-4420-953C-D85B8141A27D-300x240.webp\\u0022 alt=\\u0022\\u0022 width=\\u0022300\\u0022 height=\\u0022240\\u0022 /\\u003e\\u003cimg class=\\u0022alignnone size-medium wp-image-1048\\u0022 src=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/529E9A91-924F-41AC-BE7C-473AAF268E52-300x200.webp\\u0022 alt=\\u0022\\u0022 width=\\u0022300\\u0022 height=\\u0022200\\u0022 /\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221081\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221275\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221081\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221275\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_intro\":\"field_6a4e7a9548edd\",\"background_colour\":\"white\",\"_background_colour\":\"field_69fb291d7099f\",\"container_size\":\"medium\",\"_container_size\":\"field_6a104fa067637\",\"panel_settings\":\"\",\"_panel_settings\":\"field_6a4e7a9c48ede\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->',	'Latest News',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'latest-news',	'',	'',	'2026-07-24 23:48:12',	'2026-07-24 22:48:12',	'',	0,	'http://flightsholboxv1.local/?page_id=323',	0,	'page',	'',	0),
(325,	1,	'2026-07-08 17:45:13',	'2026-07-08 16:45:13',	'<h2><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-838\" src=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/holbox-letters-300x225.webp\" alt=\"Holbox Letters on Beach in Holbox\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></h2>\n<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"13z8bdx\" data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"193\">Private Transfer to Holbox</h3>\n<p data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"389\">A private transfer is the most convenient way to travel from Cancun Airport to Holbox by road. <strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"313\">Go Holbox Transfers</strong> offers two private transportation options for couples, families and groups.</p>\n\n<h4 data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"424\">🚐 Standard Private Transfer</h4>\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"461\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"461\">From $2,800 MXN (1–2 passengers)</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"644\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"y4u4m0\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"496\">Private air-conditioned vehicle</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"h3efex\" data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"541\">Direct transfer to Chiquilá Ferry Terminal</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1cs0i8f\" data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"568\">Flexible departure times</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"cx2w31\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"609\">No shared shuttle or unnecessary stops</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"jkm002\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"644\">Comfortable and reliable service</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"677\">⭐ VIP Premium Door-to-Door</h4>\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"715\"><strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"715\">From $11,500 MXN (1–2 passengers)</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"804\">Everything included for a seamless journey from Cancun Airport to your hotel in Holbox:</p>\n\n<ul data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"1079\">\n 	<li data-section-id=\"40m6n6\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"830\">Private luxury vehicle</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1ygld1y\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"863\">Toll road for a faster journey</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"eeqbh9\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"888\">Ferry tickets included</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lhpmdz\" data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"927\">Private golf cart taxi to your hotel</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"uzxxpw\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"966\">Complimentary drinks and cold towels</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"7ec4z3\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"982\">Onboard Wi-Fi</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"11mk9jv\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"998\">Leather seats</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1iqnia\" data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1030\">Professional bilingual driver</li>\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1mhigm1\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1079\">Door-to-door service with no planning required</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1275\">Whether you choose our Standard or VIP service, you\'ll enjoy the privacy, flexibility and comfort of traveling on your own schedule without waiting for other passengers or making multiple stops.</p>\n\n<h2>Heading 2</h2>\n&nbsp;\n\nThis is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph. This is my paragraph.',	'How to get to Holbox',	'',	'publish',	'open',	'open',	'',	'news-article-1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-24 23:53:30',	'2026-07-24 22:53:30',	'',	0,	'http://flightsholboxv1.local/?p=325',	0,	'post',	'',	0),
