(398,	2,	'2026-07-15 12:12:37',	'2026-07-15 11:12:37',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;\">\n<strong style=\"color:#081F3A;\">What are the flight times to Holbox?</strong>\nUnlike commercial airlines, our private flights don’t operate on a fixed schedule. Instead, you choose the departure time that best suits your travel plans, and we’ll do our best to accommodate your preferred schedule within our daylight operating hours.\n</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;\">\nFlexible Departure Times\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you’re wondering <strong>what are the flight times to Holbox</strong>, flights operate daily between approximately <strong>7:00 AM and 5:00 PM</strong>. Because we fly under daylight conditions only, our operating hours vary slightly throughout the year as sunrise and sunset change with the seasons.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:15px;\">\nFlights after dark are not possible because Holbox Airport does not have runway lighting.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;\">\nConnecting from Cancun Airport\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you\'re arriving on an international or domestic flight, we recommend scheduling your private flight <strong>60 to 90 minutes after landing</strong>. This allows enough time to clear immigration, collect your luggage, pass through customs, and travel to the private flight terminal.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:15px;\">\nAll Flights Holbox departures from Cancun leave from the\n<a href=\"https://share.google/ElhVUZ26QRfUryD80\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#081F3A;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">\nFBO (Fixed Base Operator)\n</a>.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;\">\nHigh-Season Availability\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFrom <strong>November through April</strong>, demand for private flights increases significantly. We recommend booking as early as possible to secure your preferred departure time.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:15px;\">\nLast-minute bookings may still be available, but departure times depend on aircraft availability.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;\">\nPrivate Flights on Your Schedule\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nBecause every flight is a private charter, you have much more flexibility than with commercial airlines. Whether you\'re flying from Cancun, Playa del Carmen, or Cozumel, we\'ll always try to schedule your departure at the most convenient time within our daylight operating hours.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin-bottom:18px;\">\nReady to Book Your Private Flight?\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\"\nstyle=\"\ndisplay:inline-block;\nbackground:#081F3A;\ncolor:#ffffff;\npadding:15px 34px;\nborder-radius:8px;\nfont-size:17px;\nfont-weight:700;\ntext-decoration:none;\nbox-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\ntransition:.3s;\n\">\nBook Your Flight\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'What Are the Flight Times to Holbox?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'flight-times-to-holbox',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 21:22:13',	'2026-07-18 20:22:13',	'',	0,	'http://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=398',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(400,	2,	'2026-07-15 12:15:03',	'2026-07-15 11:15:03',	'<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;\">\nA private flight from Cancun to Holbox takes approximately 30 minutes. Therefore, flying is by far the fastest way to reach the island. Instead of spending several hours traveling by road and ferry, you will be in the air for only half an hour.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nFlight Time from Cancun to Holbox\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nThe flight from Cancun to Holbox takes around 30 minutes. During the journey, you can enjoy aerial views of the Caribbean coastline and the Yucatán Peninsula. In addition, you will see turquoise waters before landing at Holbox Airport.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nEvery flight is a private charter reserved exclusively for your group. As a result, there are no crowded terminals, long security lines, or boarding queues. This makes the journey fast, comfortable, and stress-free.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nTotal Travel Time\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nThe flight itself takes about 30 minutes. However, we recommend arriving at the private FBO terminal around 15 minutes before departure.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThe <a href=\"https://share.google/ElhVUZ26QRfUryD80\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#081F3A;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">FBO (Fixed Base Operator)</a> has its own private terminal at Cancun International Airport. From the commercial terminals, a taxi takes approximately 5 to 10 minutes.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nIf you are arriving in Cancun on a commercial airline flight, please allow at least 60 to 90 minutes before your private flight to Holbox. This gives you enough time to collect your luggage, pass through customs, and travel to the FBO.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOverall, the journey from the moment you arrive at the FBO until you land on Holbox usually takes around 45 minutes.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nFlights from Playa del Carmen and Cozumel\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFlights Holbox also offers private flights from Playa del Carmen and Cozumel. These routes take approximately 30 minutes as well. Therefore, they are a fast and convenient option for travelers staying elsewhere in the Riviera Maya.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhy Fly Instead of Taking the Ferry?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nTraveling from Cancun to Holbox by road and ferry usually takes 2.5 to 3.5 hours. However, the total time can vary because of traffic, ferry schedules, and waiting times.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nBy comparison, a private flight avoids road traffic, multiple transfers, and ferry queues. As a result, you will arrive much faster and can begin enjoying your vacation almost immediately.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhy Choose Flights Holbox?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFlights Holbox has more than 17 years of experience. During that time, we have helped thousands of travelers reach the island safely and comfortably. Therefore, a private flight is an excellent choice for anyone looking for the quickest and easiest way to travel from Cancun to Holbox.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nReady to Fly to Holbox?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nContact Flights Holbox to check availability and book your private flight from Cancun, Playa del Carmen, or Cozumel.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nBook Your Flight\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'How Long Does It Take to Fly from Cancun to Holbox?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'how-long-does-it-take-to-fly-from-cancun-to-holbox',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 22:06:31',	'2026-07-18 21:06:31',	'',	0,	'http://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=400',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(401,	2,	'2026-07-15 12:16:05',	'2026-07-15 11:16:05',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;\">\nAirline delays can happen, and we understand that they are often beyond your control. If your flight to Cancun is delayed, do not worry. We will always do our best to help you reach Holbox. Whenever possible, we monitor incoming flights, so please provide your airline and flight number when booking.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWe\'ll Always Try to Reschedule Your Flight\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf your arrival is delayed, we will always try to move your private flight to a later departure. However, we can only do this if the change does not affect another reservation.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nBecause every flight is a private charter, another group may have reserved the aircraft later that day. During the busy season from November to April, we frequently sell all available flights. As a result, we may not always have another departure time available.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nIf an airline delay causes you to miss your scheduled departure and we cannot reschedule your flight, we cannot refund your deposit under our cancellation policy.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nAllow Enough Connection Time\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nTo reduce the risk of missing your private flight, we recommend allowing at least 60 to 90 minutes between your arrival in Cancun and your departure to Holbox.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nDuring the winter season, immigration, baggage claim, and customs may take longer than expected. Therefore, extra connection time gives you more flexibility if your airline arrives behind schedule.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOur flights depart from the <a href=\"https://share.google/ElhVUZ26QRfUryD80\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#081F3A;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">FBO (Fixed Base Operator)</a> at Cancun International Airport. Although the FBO is part of the same airport, it has its own private terminal. You will need to take a taxi from the commercial terminals, which usually takes 5 to 10 minutes.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nLate Afternoon Arrivals\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nPrivate flights operate only during daylight hours, generally between 7:00 AM and 5:00 PM. However, departure times vary slightly throughout the year because sunset times change.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nIf your airline arrives after approximately 4:00 PM, we will probably not have enough daylight to fly you to Holbox on the same day. Nevertheless, we will always look for the best available alternative.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nAlternative Travel Options\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf your flight arrives too late for a same-day departure to Holbox, we will help you choose the best solution.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOption 1: We can move your private flight to the following morning at no additional charge. In this case, you will need to spend one night in Cancun before continuing your journey.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOption 2: If we have availability, we can arrange a private ground transfer from Cancun Airport directly to the ferry terminal in Chiquilá. We will apply the deposit you already paid toward the cost of the transfer, so you will not lose that payment.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWe\'re Here to Help\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf your airline notifies you of a delay, please contact us as soon as possible. The earlier we know about the situation, the more options we will have to adjust your travel plans.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOur goal is always to get you to Holbox as quickly, safely, and comfortably as possible. Therefore, we will do everything we reasonably can to help you continue your journey.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nNeed Help With a Delayed Flight?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nContact Flights Holbox as soon as you know about your delay. We will check the available options and do our best to help you reach Holbox with as little disruption as possible.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nContact Flights Holbox\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'What Happens If My Flight to Cancun Is Delayed?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'flight-to-cancun-delayed',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 22:14:21',	'2026-07-18 21:14:21',	'',	0,	'http://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=401',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(402,	2,	'2026-07-15 12:16:35',	'2026-07-15 11:16:35',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;\">\nYou pay for your private flight to Holbox on the day of travel. To confirm your reservation, simply pay a small deposit in advance. Then, you can pay the remaining balance before departure. This flexible process secures the aircraft for your group without requiring full payment months ahead.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nDeposit Required to Confirm Your Flight\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nTo reserve your private flight to Holbox, simply pay a deposit of approximately USD 160 per aircraft for a one-way journey. Once we receive the deposit, we confirm your booking and reserve the aircraft for your chosen date and time.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nBecause every flight is a private charter, your group has exclusive use of the aircraft. Therefore, we do not sell individual seats to other travelers.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhen Do I Pay the Remaining Balance?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYou pay the remaining balance on the day of your flight, before departure. As a result, you do not need to pay the full price weeks or months in advance.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThis payment schedule gives you more flexibility if your travel plans change. At the same time, it allows us to prepare the aircraft and schedule the pilots for your journey.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nHow Can I Pay for My Flight to Holbox?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nWe offer several convenient payment methods. Therefore, you can choose the option that works best for you.\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"margin:15px 0 0 22px;padding:0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:7px;\">Credit or debit card</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:7px;\">Cash in USD or MXN</li>\n<li>PayPal for the deposit only</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nBefore your trip, you can contact our team with any payment questions. We will gladly explain the available options and help you prepare for departure.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhy Do We Only Require a Small Deposit?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nWe understand that travel plans can change. For that reason, we only request a small deposit when you book your private flight to Holbox.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThis approach gives you more peace of mind. Meanwhile, the deposit allows us to reserve the aircraft and organize the pilots for your trip.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nIf you need to change your reservation, please contact us as soon as possible. Whenever our schedule allows, we will do our best to move your flight to another available time.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nNeed Help with Your Booking?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you have questions about the deposit, payment methods, or your reservation, simply contact our team. First, we will explain the payment process. Then, we will help you confirm your private flight to Holbox with confidence.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nReady to Book Your Private Flight?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nReserve your private flight to Holbox with a small deposit. Then, pay the remaining balance on the day of travel.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nBook Your Flight\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'When Do I Pay for My Private Flight to Holbox?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'when-do-i-pay-for-my-private-flight-to-holbox',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 22:29:08',	'2026-07-18 21:29:08',	'',	0,	'http://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=402',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(403,	2,	'2026-07-15 12:17:14',	'2026-07-15 11:17:14',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYes. If you cancel your private flight to Holbox at least 14 days before departure, we will refund 100% of your deposit. If you cancel within 13 days of your flight, your deposit becomes non-refundable. However, you never pay the remaining balance until the day of travel.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nRefund If I Cancel My Flight to Holbox\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYour refund depends on when you cancel your private flight to Holbox. Therefore, we recommend contacting us as soon as your plans change.\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"margin:15px 0 0 22px;padding:0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:7px;\"><strong>14 days or more before departure:</strong> We refund 100% of your deposit.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom:7px;\"><strong>0–13 days before departure:</strong> Your deposit becomes non-refundable.</li>\n<li><strong>Remaining balance:</strong> You pay it on the day of travel before departure.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nBecause we only require a small deposit, you will never lose the remaining balance if you cancel your booking before your trip.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nCan I Reschedule Instead of Canceling?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYes. We understand that travel plans sometimes change unexpectedly. For that reason, we will always do our best to reschedule your flight whenever our schedule allows.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThe earlier you contact us, the more options we usually have. Therefore, please let us know about any changes as soon as possible.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nCan I Receive a Travel Voucher Instead of a Refund?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you cancel within 13 days of departure but notify us at least 48 hours before your flight, we may issue a travel voucher for the value of your deposit instead of forfeiting it.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nYou can apply the voucher to a future booking. However, we review every request individually because each reservation is different.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nGround Transfer Cancellation Policy\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nThe same cancellation policy applies to our private ground transfers. Transfer deposits usually range from MXN 1,000 to MXN 2,000. However, the exact amount depends on the vehicle type and the size of your group.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nIf you need to cancel or reschedule your transfer, please contact us as soon as possible. That way, we can review your booking and explain the available options.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhat Happens If We Cancel Your Flight?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nPassenger safety always comes first. If weather, operational reasons, or another situation beyond your control prevents us from operating your flight, we will refund 100% of your deposit.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nAs a result, you never lose your deposit when we cancel your private flight.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 6 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nNeed to Change Your Booking?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you need to cancel, reschedule, or ask about our cancellation policy, please contact us as early as possible. Then, we can explain your options and help you find the best solution.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOur office is open every day from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM, Cancún time. Because we receive many inquiries, emails and messages may take up to 24 hours to answer. Therefore, please avoid sending last-minute requests outside office hours whenever possible.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nNeed to Change Your Flight?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nContact Flights Holbox as soon as your travel plans change. We will explain your options and do our best to help you reschedule or process your cancellation.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nContact Flights Holbox\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'Will I Get a Refund If I Cancel My Flight to Holbox?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'refund-if-i-cancel-flight-to-holbox',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 22:46:05',	'2026-07-18 21:46:05',	'',	0,	'http://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=403',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(404,	2,	'2026-07-15 12:17:42',	'2026-07-15 11:17:42',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYes! You can bring your pet on your private flight to Holbox. We welcome both dogs and cats on our private flights and private ground transfers. Simply let us know when you book so we can prepare for your journey together.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nHow Do I Bring My Pet on a Flight to Holbox?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nTraveling with your pet is easy. First, tell us that your dog or cat will be joining your flight when you make your reservation. Then, we\'ll make sure everything is ready before your departure.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nFor everyone\'s safety, your pet should remain calm and comfortable throughout the journey. If you\'re unsure how your pet will react, we recommend bringing a secure pet crate or carrier.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nA familiar crate often helps reduce stress while also keeping your pet safe during the flight. Please bring your own crate if your pet needs one.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nCan My Pet Travel on a Ground Transfer?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYes. If you book a private transfer with Go Holbox Transfers, your pet is welcome there as well.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nTo help us keep our vehicles clean for every guest, please bring a blanket or seat protector if your pet sheds a lot of hair. That way, we can prepare the vehicle quickly for the next travelers.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nIs There an Extra Charge for Pets?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nNo. We do not charge any additional fee when you bring your pet on a flight to Holbox or travel with us by private ground transfer.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nHowever, please bring any supplies your pet may need. These may include a crate, carrier, blanket, leash, or seat protector for the journey.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nTravel Together with Confidence\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nAt Flights Holbox, we know pets are part of the family. Therefore, we\'re proud to offer pet-friendly private flights and transfers for you and your companion.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nIf you have any questions before your trip, simply contact our team. We\'ll gladly help you prepare for a safe, comfortable, and enjoyable journey with your pet.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nReady to Fly with Your Pet?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nBook your pet-friendly private flight to Holbox today. We\'ll help make your journey comfortable for both you and your four-legged companion.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nBook Your Flight\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'Can I Bring My Pet on a Flight to Holbox?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'can-i-bring-a-pet-with-me',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 22:50:08',	'2026-07-18 21:50:08',	'',	0,	'http://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=404',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
