(487,	2,	'2026-07-16 05:45:43',	'2026-07-16 04:45:43',	'<h2>1. Introduction</h2>\nThese Terms and Conditions govern your use of the Flights Holbox website and the booking of transfer services provided by Flights Holbox. By submitting a booking request, you confirm that you have read, understood and agree to these terms.\n<h2>2. Booking Requests</h2>\nSubmitting a booking request via our website does not constitute a confirmed reservation. Your booking is only confirmed once you have received a written confirmation from Flights Holbox. We reserve the right to decline any booking request.\n\nAll bookings must be made at least 24 hours in advance. We cannot guarantee availability for requests made with less than 24 hours\' notice.\n<h2>3. Pricing</h2>\nAll prices are displayed in US Dollars (USD). Prices shown exclude the Mexican federal departure tax (IVA) unless otherwise stated. The applicable tax rate will be clearly displayed at the time of booking.\n\nPrices are per group (not per person) unless otherwise specified. Flights Holbox reserves the right to amend prices at any time prior to confirmation of your booking.\n<h2>4. Payment</h2>\nPayment terms will be confirmed at the time of booking. Flights Holbox accepts payment by cash (USD or MXN) or via PayPal. Full details will be provided in your booking confirmation.\n\nPayment of the remaining balance is typically made directly to the pilot or transfer representative on the day of travel.\n<h2>5. Cancellation and Refunds</h2>\nIf you need to cancel or amend your booking, please contact us as soon as possible. Cancellation terms are as follows:\n<h3>Up to 14 days before departure/travel date</h3>\nFULL REFUND\n<h3>0-13 days before departure</h3>\nNON- REFUNDABLE\n\nFlights Holbox reserves the right to cancel or reschedule transfers due to adverse weather conditions, mechanical issues, or other circumstances beyond our control. In such cases, a full refund or alternative arrangement will be offered.\n<h2>6. Weather and Safety</h2>\nAll flights operate subject to safe weather conditions. The pilot has absolute authority over the decision to fly and may cancel or delay a flight at any time on safety grounds. No compensation will be payable in such circumstances, though we will endeavour to reschedule or refund where possible.\n<h2>7. Luggage</h2>\nLuggage allowances are limited due to the nature of light aircraft. Maximum luggage dimensions and weights will be communicated at the time of booking. Flights Holbox cannot be held responsible for any loss or damage to luggage during transit.\n<h2>8. Passenger Responsibility</h2>\nPassengers are responsible for ensuring they are at the designated pick-up point at the agreed time. Flights Holbox cannot be held liable for missed transfers due to late arrival. Passengers must ensure they hold valid travel documents for any onward journeys.\n<h2>9. Liability</h2>\nFlights Holbox\'s liability is limited to the cost of the transfer service booked. We accept no responsibility for indirect or consequential losses, including missed connecting flights, accommodation costs, or other travel arrangements.\n\nAll transfers are operated in compliance with applicable Mexican aviation and transport regulations.\n<h2>10. Privacy</h2>\nYour personal data is processed in accordance with our <a href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>. By submitting a booking request, you consent to your data being used to process and manage your transfer.\n<h2>11. Governing Law</h2>\nThese Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of Mexico. Any disputes arising from your use of our services shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts of Mexico.\n<h2>12. Changes to These Terms</h2>\nFlights Holbox reserves the right to update these Terms and Conditions at any time. The current version will always be available on this page. Continued use of our services following any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.\n<h2>13. Contact</h2>\nIf you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please <a href=\"/contact\">contact us</a>.',	'Terms and Conditions',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'230-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-16 05:45:43',	'2026-07-16 04:45:43',	'',	230,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?p=487',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
(488,	2,	'2026-07-16 05:45:54',	'2026-07-16 04:45:54',	'<h2>1. Introduction</h2>\n<p>These Terms and Conditions govern your use of the Flights Holbox website and the booking of transfer services provided by Flights Holbox. By submitting a booking request, you confirm that you have read, understood and agree to these terms.</p>\n\n<h2>2. Booking Requests</h2>\n<p>Submitting a booking request via our website does not constitute a confirmed reservation. Your booking is only confirmed once you have received a written confirmation from Flights Holbox. We reserve the right to decline any booking request.</p>\n<p>All bookings must be made at least 24 hours in advance. We cannot guarantee availability for requests made with less than 24 hours\' notice.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Pricing</h2>\n<p>All prices are displayed in US Dollars (USD). Prices shown exclude the Mexican federal departure tax (IVA) unless otherwise stated. The applicable tax rate will be clearly displayed at the time of booking.</p>\n<p>Prices are per group (not per person) unless otherwise specified. Flights Holbox reserves the right to amend prices at any time prior to confirmation of your booking.</p>\n\n<h2>4. Payment</h2>\n<p>Payment terms will be confirmed at the time of booking. Flights Holbox accepts payment by cash (USD or MXN) or via PayPal. Full details will be provided in your booking confirmation.</p>\n<p>Payment of the remaining balance is typically made directly to the pilot or transfer representative on the day of travel.</p>\n\n<h2>5. Cancellation and Refunds</h2>\n<p>If you need to cancel or amend your booking, please contact us as soon as possible. Cancellation terms are as follows:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>More than 48 hours before departure:</strong> Full refund of any deposit paid.</li>\n  <li><strong>24–48 hours before departure:</strong> 50% of the total fare may be retained.</li>\n  <li><strong>Less than 24 hours before departure:</strong> No refund will be issued.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Flights Holbox reserves the right to cancel or reschedule transfers due to adverse weather conditions, mechanical issues, or other circumstances beyond our control. In such cases, a full refund or alternative arrangement will be offered.</p>\n\n<h2>6. Weather and Safety</h2>\n<p>All flights operate subject to safe weather conditions. The pilot has absolute authority over the decision to fly and may cancel or delay a flight at any time on safety grounds. No compensation will be payable in such circumstances, though we will endeavour to reschedule or refund where possible.</p>\n\n<h2>7. Luggage</h2>\n<p>Luggage allowances are limited due to the nature of light aircraft. Maximum luggage dimensions and weights will be communicated at the time of booking. Flights Holbox cannot be held responsible for any loss or damage to luggage during transit.</p>\n\n<h2>8. Passenger Responsibility</h2>\n<p>Passengers are responsible for ensuring they are at the designated pick-up point at the agreed time. Flights Holbox cannot be held liable for missed transfers due to late arrival. Passengers must ensure they hold valid travel documents for any onward journeys.</p>\n\n<h2>9. Liability</h2>\n<p>Flights Holbox\'s liability is limited to the cost of the transfer service booked. We accept no responsibility for indirect or consequential losses, including missed connecting flights, accommodation costs, or other travel arrangements.</p>\n<p>All transfers are operated in compliance with applicable Mexican aviation and transport regulations.</p>\n\n<h2>10. Privacy</h2>\n<p>Your personal data is processed in accordance with our <a href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>. By submitting a booking request, you consent to your data being used to process and manage your transfer.</p>\n\n<h2>11. Governing Law</h2>\n<p>These Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of Mexico. Any disputes arising from your use of our services shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts of Mexico.</p>\n\n<h2>12. Changes to These Terms</h2>\n<p>Flights Holbox reserves the right to update these Terms and Conditions at any time. The current version will always be available on this page. Continued use of our services following any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>\n\n<h2>13. Contact</h2>\n<p>If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please <a href=\"/contact\">contact us</a>.</p>',	'Terms and Conditions',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'230-autosave-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-07-16 05:45:54',	'2026-07-16 04:45:54',	'',	230,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?p=488',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
(550,	2,	'2026-07-18 01:40:56',	'2026-07-18 00:40:56',	'<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYes, flying with Flights Holbox is safe. Safety is our highest priority, and we never compromise when it comes to our passengers or our aircraft. As a fully licensed commercial air charter operator in Mexico, we follow strict aviation regulations on every private flight.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nLicensed Pilots and Professionally Maintained Aircraft\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nEvery private flight is operated by licensed commercial pilots with experience flying regional routes throughout the Yucatán Peninsula. In addition, certified aircraft technicians maintain and inspect our aircraft according to Mexican aviation regulations.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nFlights Holbox operates the reliable Cessna 206. Airlines and charter operators around the world trust this aircraft for regional flights because it offers excellent reliability, performance, and a strong safety record.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWeather Always Comes First\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nBefore every departure, we carefully check the latest weather conditions. If the weather is not suitable for safe flying, we will delay or reschedule your flight.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nAlthough weather delays can occasionally affect your travel plans, we will never compromise on safety. Your well-being always comes before convenience.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nPrivate Flights for Your Group\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nEvery flight is a private charter. Therefore, we reserve the entire aircraft exclusively for your group. You will never share the flight with strangers.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThis gives you a more comfortable, flexible, and personalized travel experience. Each aircraft accommodates up to five passengers. If your group is larger, we can arrange multiple aircraft so everyone can travel together.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nMore Than 17 Years of Experience\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFor more than 17 years, Flights Holbox has provided safe and reliable private flights between Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Cozumel, and Holbox. During that time, thousands of travelers have trusted us for vacations, family trips, weddings, business travel, and special occasions.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOur goal is simple. We want every passenger to enjoy a fast, comfortable, and safe journey while receiving excellent customer service from booking to landing.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nBook with Confidence\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you\'re looking for the safest and fastest way to reach Holbox, you can book with confidence. We focus on safety, professionalism, and customer service on every private flight.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nFrom regular aircraft maintenance to experienced pilots and careful weather monitoring, every decision we make puts your safety first.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nReady to Fly Safely to Holbox?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nBook your private flight with Flights Holbox and enjoy a fast, comfortable, and safe journey with experienced pilots and professionally maintained aircraft.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nBook Your Flight\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'Is flying with Flights Holbox safe?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'is-flying-with-flights-holbox-safe',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 22:53:08',	'2026-07-18 21:53:08',	'',	0,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=550',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(565,	2,	'2026-07-18 03:03:22',	'2026-07-18 02:03:22',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nThe fastest way to get from Cancun to Holbox is by private flight. A flight takes approximately 30 minutes, while traveling by road and ferry usually takes between 2.5 and 3.5 hours. Flights Holbox offers fully licensed private charter flights, allowing you to avoid traffic, ferry lines, and crowded public transportation.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nPrivate Flights from Cancun\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nA private flight from Cancun to Holbox takes about 30 minutes. Therefore, it is the fastest and most comfortable way to reach the island.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nEvery flight is a private charter operated by experienced commercial pilots. As a result, you travel only with your group and avoid long road journeys, ferry queues, and unnecessary waiting.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOur reliable Cessna 206 accommodates up to five passengers. However, if your group is larger, we can arrange multiple aircraft to depart at the same time.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nPrivate Ground Transfer and Ferry\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you prefer to travel by road, our partner <a href=\"https://goholboxtransfers.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Go Holbox Transfers</a> offers private door-to-door transportation from Cancun Airport to the ferry terminal in Chiquilá.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nFrom there, you\'ll board the passenger ferry for the short crossing to Holbox. Altogether, the journey usually takes between 2.5 and 3.5 hours, depending on traffic and the ferry schedule.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nRental Car or Bus\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYou can also rent a car or take a public bus from Cancun to Chiquilá before boarding the ferry. This is the most affordable option. However, it also takes the longest.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nMost bus journeys take more than three hours and include several stops. In addition, only a limited number of buses operate each day, so you\'ll have less flexibility than with a private transfer or flight.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhich Option Is Best?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf speed and convenience are your priorities, a private flight to Holbox is the best choice. You\'ll arrive on the island in about 30 minutes and avoid traffic, ferry queues, and long travel times.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nOn the other hand, if you\'re looking for a lower-cost option, a private ground transfer or public transportation may be a better fit. The right choice depends on your budget, schedule, and travel style.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nMore Than 17 Years of Experience\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFor more than 17 years, Flights Holbox and <a href=\"https://goholboxtransfers.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Go Holbox Transfers</a> have helped thousands of travelers reach Holbox safely, comfortably, and on time.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nWhether you choose a private flight or a private transfer, our experienced team will help you enjoy a smooth and stress-free journey from Cancun to Holbox.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nReady to Travel to Holbox?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nBook your private flight or private transfer today and enjoy the fastest, easiest, and most comfortable way to reach Holbox.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nBook Your Journey\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'How do i get from Cancun to Holbox?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'how-to-get-from-cancun-to-holbox',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 22:59:10',	'2026-07-18 21:59:10',	'',	0,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=565',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(566,	2,	'2026-07-18 03:37:56',	'2026-07-18 02:37:56',	'<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fastest way to get to Holbox is by private flight. Flights Holbox offers private flights from Cancun, Playa del Carmen, and Cozumel, with most journeys taking around 30 minutes. Compared to traveling by road and ferry, which usually takes 2.5 to 3.5 hours from Cancun, flying is the quickest and most comfortable option.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#120781\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#120781\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#120781\">Why Choose a Private Flight?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A private flight lets you avoid traffic, ferry queues, and multiple transfers. Instead, you\'ll enjoy breathtaking views of the Caribbean Sea before landing just minutes from the island\'s center.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you\'re traveling for a vacation, honeymoon, business trip, or special event, flying saves valuable time and lets you start your holiday sooner.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#120781\"}}},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#120781\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#120781\">Private Flights with Flights Holbox</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Flights Holbox operates fully licensed private charter flights using the reliable <strong>Cessna 206</strong>. Our licensed commercial pilots fly every flight, while certified technicians maintain every aircraft to the highest safety standards.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Each flight is reserved exclusively for your group, so you\'ll never share the aircraft with other travelers. We can accommodate up to five passengers per plane, offering a comfortable and flexible travel experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Traveling with more than five people? We can arrange multiple aircraft to depart at the same time, allowing families, wedding parties, and larger groups to travel together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#120781\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#120781\"}}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#120781\">Private Ground Transfers</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"\"} -->\n<p>If you prefer to travel by road, our partner <strong><a href=\"https://goholboxtransfers.com/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://goholboxtransfers.com/\">Go Holbox Transfers</a></strong> provides reliable private transfers from Cancun Airport. The journey continues to Chiquilá, where you\'ll board the ferry for the short crossing to the island.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While this option is more economical, it takes considerably longer than flying.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#120781\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#120781\"}}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#120781\">Why Fly with Flights Holbox?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With more than 17 years of experience, we\'ve helped thousands of travelers reach their destination safely, quickly, and comfortably.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re looking for the quickest and most convenient way to travel, a private flight from Cancun, Playa del Carmen, or Cozumel is the best choice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->',	'What is the fastest way to get to Holbox?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'fastest-way-to-get-to-holbox',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 06:19:39',	'2026-07-18 05:19:39',	'',	0,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=566',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(628,	2,	'2026-07-18 19:18:27',	'2026-07-18 18:18:27',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nOur <strong>Holbox flight luggage allowance</strong> depends on the number of passengers traveling. Because every private flight has a maximum weight limit, the available baggage space changes based on the total weight of your group. We\'ll always confirm your luggage allowance before departure so there are no surprises on the day of travel.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 18px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nLuggage Allowance\n</h2>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;\">\n<th style=\"padding:14px;text-align:left;\">Passengers</th>\n<th style=\"padding:14px;text-align:left;\">Luggage Allowance</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n<td style=\"padding:14px;font-weight:600;\">1–3 Passengers</td>\n<td style=\"padding:14px;\">\n✅ 1 Carry-on bag<br>\n✅ 1 Checked suitcase<br>\n<strong>Maximum 20 kg (44 lbs) per person</strong><br><br>\n\n<strong>Large luggage welcome:</strong> With 1–3 passengers, we can often accommodate larger items such as kiteboarding equipment, diving gear, fishing gear, sports equipment, or oversized luggage, provided the combined passenger and luggage weight does not exceed <strong>330 kg (727 lbs)</strong>. Please contact us before your flight so we can confirm your luggage requirements.\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\">\n<td style=\"padding:14px;font-weight:600;\">4–5 Passengers</td>\n<td style=\"padding:14px;\">\n✅ 1 Carry-on bag only<br>\n❌ No checked luggage<br>\n<strong>Maximum 10 kg (22 lbs) per person</strong>\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;\">\nFor safety reasons, the combined weight of all passengers and luggage cannot exceed <strong>330 kg (727 lbs)</strong>. Therefore, the final luggage allowance depends on the total weight of your group.\n</p>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:18px;background:#FFF8E8;border-left:4px solid #D4A017;padding:18px;border-radius:8px;\">\n<strong>Please note:</strong> If your group exceeds the luggage allowance, we can arrange a second aircraft or organize a separate luggage transfer by road directly to or from your hotel.\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhy Is the Luggage Allowance Limited?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nSafety always comes first. Every aircraft has a maximum takeoff weight established by the manufacturer and required by aviation regulations. Therefore, we carefully calculate the combined weight of passengers and luggage before every flight.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThese calculations allow our pilots to operate the aircraft safely while providing the best possible performance throughout the journey.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nTraveling with Extra Luggage\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf your group is carrying more luggage than the aircraft can safely accommodate, don\'t worry. We can usually offer two convenient solutions.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nYou may book a second aircraft for your group. Alternatively, we can arrange a luggage transfer by road directly to or from your hotel. Our team will recommend the best option based on your travel plans.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nTell Us About Your Luggage Before You Fly\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nPlease let us know how many bags your group will bring when you make your reservation. Then, we can confirm your luggage allowance before your travel date.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nBy planning ahead, we can ensure a smooth check-in and help you avoid any last-minute changes at the airport.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nQuestions About Your Luggage?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nContact Flights Holbox before your trip. We\'ll confirm your <strong>Holbox flight luggage allowance</strong> and help you find the best solution for your group.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nContact Us\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->',	'How Much Luggage Can I Bring?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'holbox-flight-luggage-allowance',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 23:35:14',	'2026-07-18 22:35:14',	'',	0,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=628',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(630,	2,	'2026-07-18 19:19:43',	'2026-07-18 18:19:43',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYes, in most cases you can <strong>bring sports equipment</strong> on your private flight to Holbox. The available space depends on the number of passengers traveling and the combined weight of everyone and their luggage. We\'ll always confirm whether your equipment can be accommodated before your flight.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 18px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhat Sports Equipment Can I Bring?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nWe can often transport a wide variety of sports equipment, including:\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"margin:18px 0 0 20px;padding:0;\">\n<li>Kiteboarding equipment</li>\n<li>Diving gear</li>\n<li>Fishing equipment</li>\n<li>Surfboards (depending on their dimensions)</li>\n<li>Other oversized luggage or sports gear</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;\">\nPlease let us know exactly what you plan to bring so we can confirm that everything fits safely inside the aircraft.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhen Is There Enough Space?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nWith <strong>1–3 passengers</strong>, there is usually enough room for larger sports equipment because more baggage space is available.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nWith <strong>4–5 passengers</strong>, we can only accept one small carry-on bag per person. Unfortunately, sports equipment and oversized luggage cannot be accommodated on fully occupied flights.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWeight Limits Still Apply\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nEven when there is enough space inside the aircraft, the total combined weight of all passengers and luggage cannot exceed <strong>330 kg (727 lbs)</strong>.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nTherefore, if you plan to <strong>bring sports equipment</strong>, please contact us before booking. We\'ll confirm whether your equipment can travel on the same flight.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nBest Option for Large Groups or Extra Luggage\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf your group is traveling with more sports equipment than the aircraft can safely carry, we can recommend two convenient alternatives.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nYou may reserve a second aircraft for additional passengers or luggage. Alternatively, we can arrange a luggage transfer by road directly to or from your hotel. We\'ll help you choose the most practical solution based on your group size and equipment.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nTraveling with Sports Equipment?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nContact Flights Holbox before your trip. We\'ll confirm whether your sports equipment can travel with you and recommend the best option for your group.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nContact Us\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->',	'Can I Bring Sports Equipment?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'bring-sports-equipment-holbox',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 23:44:38',	'2026-07-18 22:44:38',	'',	0,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=630',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(631,	2,	'2026-07-18 19:21:29',	'2026-07-18 18:21:29',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nUnfortunately, there is <strong>no luggage storage at the private airports</strong> we operate from around Cancun. If you\'re wondering, <strong>does Cancun Airport have luggage storage</strong>, the answer is that our private terminals do not offer this service. If you\'re traveling with more luggage than your flight can accommodate, we can help you find an alternative solution.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 18px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nIs Luggage Storage Available?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nNo. The private airports used by Flights Holbox do not provide luggage storage facilities. Therefore, all luggage must travel with you or be transported using another service.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nIf your luggage exceeds the aircraft\'s baggage allowance, it cannot be left at the airport for later collection.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhat If I Have Too Much Luggage?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf your group has more luggage than your aircraft can safely carry, we offer two convenient alternatives.\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"margin:18px 0 0 20px;padding:0;\">\n<li>Reserve a second aircraft for the additional luggage or passengers.</li>\n<li>Arrange a dedicated luggage transfer by road directly to or from your hotel.</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nGround Luggage Transfer\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nOur luggage transfer service allows your larger suitcases or oversized items to travel by road while you enjoy the fastest flight to Holbox.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThe service costs <strong>USD 350</strong> and includes transportation directly to or from your hotel. This is often the most economical solution if only your luggage exceeds the aircraft\'s weight or space limits.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nContact Us Before Your Flight\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you\'re unsure whether your luggage will fit on the aircraft, please let us know before booking. We\'ll review your baggage requirements and recommend the best option for your group.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nPlanning ahead helps avoid delays on your travel day and ensures a smooth departure.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nNeed Help With Extra Luggage?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nContact Flights Holbox before your trip. We\'ll help you find the best solution for excess luggage, whether that\'s a second aircraft or our road luggage transfer service.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#081F3A;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(8,31,58,.18);\">\nContact Us\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->',	'Does Cancun Airport Have Luggage Storage?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'does-cancun-airport-have-luggage-storage',	'',	'',	'2026-07-18 23:54:22',	'2026-07-18 22:54:22',	'',	0,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=631',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(632,	2,	'2026-07-18 19:22:39',	'2026-07-18 18:22:39',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhy Is Luggage Capacity Limited?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nEvery aircraft has strict weight and balance limits. <strong>For this reason</strong>, these limits protect passengers and help the aircraft operate safely.\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">\nThe 330 kg Total Weight Limit\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nThe combined weight of all passengers and luggage cannot exceed <strong>330 kg (727 lbs)</strong>. <strong>Therefore</strong>, the available baggage space also depends on how many people are traveling.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nOption 1: Reserve a Second Aircraft\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf your group is traveling with many suitcases or large sports equipment, the easiest solution may be to reserve a second aircraft. <strong>As a result</strong>, you\'ll have additional space for passengers and luggage while everyone arrives in Holbox at nearly the same time.\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">\nWhen Is a Second Plane Best?\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIt may be the best choice when your group wants to arrive together. <strong>In addition</strong>, it works well when the luggage cannot travel safely by road.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nOption 2: Send Your Luggage by Road\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nA dedicated road transfer is often the most economical option. <strong>Meanwhile</strong>, your larger suitcases or equipment travel separately while you enjoy your private flight to Holbox.\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">\nCost of the Luggage Transfer\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nThe road luggage transfer costs an additional <strong>USD 350</strong>. <strong>Additionally</strong>, it can be arranged directly to or from your hotel.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThe service is provided with help from\n<a href=\"https://goholboxtransfers.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#081F3A;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">Go Holbox Transfers</a>.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nTell Us What You Are Bringing\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nPlease contact us before booking. <strong>Simply</strong> tell us the number of suitcases, their approximate weight, and whether you have oversized items.\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">\nInclude Oversized Equipment\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nPlease mention kiteboarding gear, diving equipment, fishing equipment, surfboards, or other large items. <strong>This way</strong>, we can confirm whether everything fits safely inside the aircraft.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhich Option Should I Choose?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nA second aircraft is usually better for large groups or valuable equipment. <strong>On the other hand</strong>, a road transfer is often the better choice when only the luggage exceeds the flight allowance.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\n<strong>Finally</strong>, our team will review your details and explain both options. This helps you avoid delays and unexpected changes on the day of departure.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->',	'What Are My Options If I Have Too Much Luggage?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'what-are-my-options-if-i-have-too-much-luggage',	'',	'',	'2026-07-19 00:03:38',	'2026-07-18 23:03:38',	'',	0,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=632',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(633,	1,	'2026-07-18 19:23:55',	'2026-07-18 18:23:55',	'<!-- wp:acf/faq-steps-panel {\"name\":\"acf/faq-steps-panel\",\"data\":{\"heading\":\"Book Your Flight in Three Simple Steps\",\"_heading\":\"field_6a6dfd6ceb39f\",\"steps_0_steps_heading\":\"Complete the Request Form\",\"_steps_0_steps_heading\":\"field_6a6dfd8feb3a1\",\"steps_0_step_text\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nFirst, fill out the flight request form on our website. Please include your travel date, preferred time, route, number of passengers, and luggage details.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_steps_0_step_text\":\"field_6a6dfd9beb3a2\",\"steps_1_steps_heading\":\"Wait for Confirmation and Your Payment Link\",\"_steps_1_steps_heading\":\"field_6a6dfd8feb3a1\",\"steps_1_step_text\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nNext, our team will check aircraft and pilot availability. Once everything is available, we will send you the flight details and a secure payment link for the deposit.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_steps_1_step_text\":\"field_6a6dfd9beb3a2\",\"steps_2_steps_heading\":\"Receive Your Booking Confirmation\",\"_steps_2_steps_heading\":\"field_6a6dfd8feb3a1\",\"steps_2_step_text\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nFinally, we will confirm your reservation after receiving the deposit. Your confirmation will include the agreed route, date, departure time, and other important flight information.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_steps_2_step_text\":\"field_6a6dfd9beb3a2\",\"steps\":3,\"_steps\":\"field_6a6dfd7eeb3a0\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;font-family:inherit;color:#3f3f46;line-height:1.75;\">\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIt is easy to <strong>book a private flight to Holbox</strong>. First, send us your travel details through our website. Then, our team will check aircraft availability and confirm the price. Finally, you secure your reservation by paying the requested deposit.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nBook Your Flight in Three Simple Steps\n</h2>\n\n<!-- STEP 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:2px solid #F4A000;border-radius:10px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">\n\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;\">\n\n<div style=\"min-width:46px;height:46px;background:#F4A000;color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;\">\n1\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;\">\nComplete the Request Form\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFirst, fill out the flight request form on our website. Please include your travel date, preferred time, route, number of passengers, and luggage details.\n</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- STEP 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:2px solid #F4A000;border-radius:10px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">\n\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;\">\n\n<div style=\"min-width:46px;height:46px;background:#F4A000;color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;\">\n2\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;\">\nWait for Confirmation and Your Payment Link\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nNext, our team will check aircraft and pilot availability. Once everything is available, we will send you the flight details and a secure payment link for the deposit.\n</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- STEP 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:2px solid #F4A000;border-radius:10px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">\n\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;\">\n\n<div style=\"min-width:46px;height:46px;background:#F4A000;color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;\">\n3\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 7px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;\">\nReceive Your Booking Confirmation\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFinally, we will confirm your reservation after receiving the deposit. Your confirmation will include the agreed route, date, departure time, and other important flight information.\n</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nEach Flight Is Booked Separately\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nEvery trip is a separate booking. Therefore, a flight from Cancun to Holbox does not automatically include the return flight from Holbox to Cancun.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nIf you need a round trip, please request both journeys. We will check availability for each flight separately and send you the total price before you pay.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nAre Flight Prices One Way?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nYes. All prices shown or quoted by Flights Holbox are for a <strong>one-way private flight</strong>, unless we clearly state otherwise.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nBecause each direction requires its own aircraft reservation, the return journey has a separate price. In addition, availability may differ between the outbound and return dates.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nHow Far in Advance Should I Book?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nWe need to receive your booking request at least <strong>24 hours before your preferred departure time</strong>. However, you must also send the request during our regular office opening hours.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nFor example, a request sent late at night for the following morning may not give our team enough time to organize the flight. Therefore, we recommend booking as early as possible.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhat Information Should I Provide?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nTo process your request quickly, please provide the full names of all passengers. Also include the approximate passenger weights and the number of bags you plan to bring.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nAdditionally, tell us about checked suitcases, sports equipment, surfboards, diving gear, or other oversized items. This way, we can check the aircraft\'s weight and luggage capacity before confirming your flight.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nReady to Fly to Holbox?\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nComplete our request form to <strong>book a private flight to Holbox</strong>. Our team will check availability and send you the next steps.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#F4A000;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(244,160,0,.25);\">\nRequest Your Flight\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->',	'How Do I Book A Private Flight To Holbox?',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'how-do-i-book-a-private-flight-to-holbox',	'',	'',	'2026-08-01 15:09:40',	'2026-08-01 14:09:40',	'',	0,	'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?post_type=faq&#038;p=633',	0,	'faq',	'',	0),
(634,	2,	'2026-07-18 19:27:10',	'2026-07-18 18:27:10',	'<!-- wp:html -->\n\n\n<!-- INTRO CARD -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nIf you are wondering <strong>when should I book my flight to Holbox</strong>, we recommend booking as soon as you know your travel dates. Although we require at least 24 hours\' notice, booking earlier gives you a better choice of departure dates and times.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 1 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhat Is the Minimum Booking Time?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nWe need to receive your confirmed booking at least <strong>24 hours before departure</strong>. However, the request must also arrive during our regular office opening hours.\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">\nWhy Is Advance Notice Required?\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFirst, our team must check aircraft and pilot availability. In addition, we need time to organize the flight and confirm all passenger details. Therefore, a request sent late at night may not be possible for the following morning.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 2 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhy Should I Book as Early as Possible?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nPrivate flights operate with a limited number of aircraft. As a result, your preferred departure time may no longer be available if another group books first.\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">\nSecure the Date and Time That Suit You\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nBooking early gives you the best chance of securing the date and time that fit your plans. Moreover, it gives us more time to coordinate your arrival, luggage, and ground transportation.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 3 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nHow Early Should I Book During High Season?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nOur busiest travel period usually runs from <strong>November through April</strong>. During these months, flights often become fully booked.\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">\nBook at Least 2–4 Weeks Ahead\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nFor high-season travel, we recommend booking at least <strong>two to four weeks in advance</strong>. However, Christmas, New Year, Easter, and other popular dates may fill even earlier.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nTherefore, booking as soon as your travel dates are known is always the safest choice.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 4 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nWhat If My Travel Dates Change?\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nTravel plans sometimes change after a flight has been booked. Fortunately, we can usually adjust your booking to a new date or time without an extra change fee.\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 8px;color:#081F3A;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">\nChanges Depend on Availability\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nThe new flight time must still be available. Therefore, please contact us as soon as you know that your plans have changed. The earlier you tell us, the easier it is to find a suitable alternative.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- SECTION 5 -->\n<div style=\"background:#FAFBFD;border-left:4px solid #081F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#081F3A;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">\nPlan Your Complete Journey\n</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\nBesides your flight, remember to plan transportation to or from the private airport. For example, \n<a href=\"https://goholboxtransfers.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#081F3A;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">Go Holbox Transfers</a>\ncan help arrange private ground transportation.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0;\">\nThis way, your flight and ground transfer can work together smoothly. In addition, early planning reduces waiting time and last-minute changes.\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:45px;padding:34px 24px;background:#FAFBFD;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#081F3A;margin:0 0 8px;\">\nSecure Your Preferred Flight Time\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;color:#52525b;\">\nContact Flights Holbox as soon as you know your travel dates. We will check availability and help you reserve the most convenient departure time.\n</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://flightsholboxv1.local/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#F4A000;color:#ffffff;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(244,160,0,.25);\">\nRequest Your Flight\n</a>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->',	'How Far in Advance Should I Book My Flight to Holbox?',	