ast thing you need is to feel stressed about your transfer. We are a professional, experienced and safe operator. Flights Holbox is one of the few operators in the Riviera Maya offering fully licensed flights (air taxis) or vans (ground transfer) with more the 17 years of experience. Book your private air plane between Cancun, Holbox, Cozumel or Playa del Carmen.\",\"_columns_0_column_content\":\"field_6a48ca046d857\",\"columns_1_column_content\":\"Our private planes only fly between 7:00 and 17:30. Flight times can change depend on season and day light.Its not possible to fly to Holbox at night. Flights Holbox use the FBO at the International Airport of Cancún. Changing terminals in Cancun requires a pre-booked Taxi- we can help you setting up your taxi. Taking a taxi cost around 20-30 USD. (5 min ride). If you\'re flying out of Cancún airport you\'ll need to pay an airport tax of around 10 USD - unless you\'re flying into and out of Cancún airport on the same day. There are only a few ATMs on Isla Holbox, we suggest to bring enough cash to the island. We accept card payments, cash, bank transfer or Paypal. You can get to FBO airport in Cancún only by taxi you can\'t walk.\",\"_columns_1_column_content\":\"field_6a48ca046d857\",\"columns\":2,\"_columns\":\"field_6a48c9ed6d856\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/route-map-panel {\"name\":\"acf/route-map-panel\",\"data\":{\"route_map_heading\":\"This is a heading\",\"_route_map_heading\":\"field_6a4d2d2aabb82\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/social-panel {\"name\":\"acf/social-panel\",\"data\":{\"heading\":\"This is a heading\",\"_heading\":\"field_6a4eb753d02cb\",\"description\":\"This is a description\",\"_description\":\"field_6a4eb96ad02cc\",\"button_link_button_link\":{\"title\":\"Find out more\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_button_link_button_link\":\"field_6a10337e94d01\",\"button_link_button_colour\":\"white\",\"_button_link_button_colour\":\"field_69fb154a3681d\",\"button_link\":\"\",\"_b